WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
Midnight.

2
00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:04.330
An old railway carriage rattles west.

3
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.280
An oily lamp swings from the roof.

4
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.990
"In the third-class seat sat the journeying
boy," A ticket pokes from his hat

5
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:12.880
band.

6
00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.990
A key on a string glints at his neck.

7
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.910
Nobody sits beside him.

8
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.980
Only the passenger opposite, who
can't stop thinking about him.

9
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.390
Who is this boy?

10
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:25.800
And what does the watcher see in him?

11
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:30.700
In this mission, you'll spot the details
that show this boy is travelling alone.

12
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.270
You'll hear the speaker
stop describing the boy,

13
00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.200
and start speaking to him.

14
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.060
And you'll ask why Hardy,
publishing in 1917,

15
00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.390
filled the poem with questions.

16
00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.040
Your mission: work out what
the watcher sees in him.
